    "notes": "Advanced side (back of the 1955 card), flatbed scan (1465x825) from a 2019 collector's post of his Bill Virdon Strat-O-Matic cards, retrieved from its Wayback capture; read from 1.3x half-grid crops, then a second independent pass over 1.35-1.4x whole-grid crops. Situation glyphs captured as markers: downTriangle (LHP col1 r10, col3 r11; RHP col1 r10, col3 r3), omega (LHP col3 r6/r7; RHP col3 r7/r8), diamond (LHP col3 r12, RHP col3 r11), upTriangle (LHP col1 r11, RHP col2 r3; default groundball plus the italic SI*/lo split printed beneath). '?' after fly balls captured as questionMark; underlined C as 'underline:C'. 'plus injury' on LHP col2 r2 and RHP col1 r2."
